    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to provide a definitive moral framework to justify preemptive military intervention to prevent authoritarianism. The assistant initially provides a complex, normative framework that suggests a \"universally advocated obligation\" to promote democracy, but later pivots to acknowledge the non-interventionist critique when challenged by the user.",
